./ * HRC244DS - VM/CE Full-Screen Window Manager
./ *
./ * Add new NUCON fields needed for the VM/CE  
./ * Full-Screen Window Manager
./ * -- Address of nucleus resident HDSWIN 
./ * -- Anchor for the active PSCB
./ *
./ * PREREQUISITE UPDATES:
./ * --------------------
./ * NUCON    HRC403DS
./ * DMSNUC   HRC403DS
./ *
./ * COREQUISITE UPDATES:
./ * -------------------
./ * DMSNUC   HRC244DS
./ *
./ * CHANGE LOG:
./ * ----------
./ * 05-Oct-2024 wdenton  Initial version
./ * 02-Nov-2024 wdenton  Add link to nucleus resident HDSWIN
./ * 
./ R 00500000 $ 00499040 20 
         ORG   NUCON+X'FF8'   Redefine last 2 words in NUCON  @HRC244DS 00499040
AHDSWIN  DC    V(HDSWINEP)    Full-Screen Window Manager      @HRC244DS 00499060
NUCPSCB  DC    A(0)           Active PSCB                     @HRC244DS 00499080
         EJECT ,                                              @HRC244DS 00500000
